# Tabulated current waveform fixture for the circuit drive-source unit test
# (unit_tests/drive_source_test), issue [9a]/#21, ADR-0005.
#
# Format (whitespace-delimited ASCII; '#' comment lines skipped):
#   npts
#   t_0   I_0          (time and load current, code units; time strictly ascending)
#   ...
# Piecewise-linear segments with simple slopes so the interpolation/clamping checks have
# exact closed-form expected values:
#   I(0)=0, I(1)=10, I(2)=30, I(4)=30  ->  I(0.5)=5, I(1.5)=20, clamp(<0)=0, clamp(>4)=30.
4
0.0   0.0
1.0   10.0
2.0   30.0
4.0   30.0
